summary:
  The answer to the heal's second look is taken for whatever plays now,
  whether or not the move it was asked for still stands.

history:
  The look is asked while the stopgap plays. Stop the radio, start the same
  station again from its saved address, and the old look's answer arrives to
  a state that passes every check it had: same station, playing, nothing
  pending. It then wrote the stopgap's address into the list, the alarms and
  the scheduled recordings while the saved address was playing. Found
  2026-11-10 before release. The answer now counts only while the very move
  it was asked for is still the one waiting.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                  if (root._healLater !== m || root._currentOrigUrl !== m.oldUrl || !isPlaying() || root._healPendingUrl !== "") return;

replace:
                  if (root._healLater === null || root._currentOrigUrl !== m.oldUrl || !isPlaying() || root._healPendingUrl !== "") return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_heal_is_written_only_over_an_address_that_stayed_dead.
  Line-neutral.
